    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything just feels so quiet now. like, it's not just that i can't compete anymore, it's that the person who actually lived my life is just... gone. it feels like i'm just a ghost inhabiting a body that doesn't even do what it's supposed to do anymore. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the girl there. she's just some shell of what i was.",
